This repository contains only an installer and agent instructions.

The MCP server and the "Figma Desktop Bridge" Figma plugin it installs are a
separate project:

  figma-console-mcp
  https://github.com/southleft/figma-console-mcp
  Copyright (c) 2025 Figma Console MCP Contributors
  MIT License

No source code from that project is redistributed here. install.sh fetches it
from the public npm registry (package: figma-console-mcp) at install time, and
the server itself writes the plugin files into ~/.figma-console-mcp/plugin on
the user's machine.

